:: day2_gardens_hub [nobr]
<<locationImage "royal_gardens" "Royal Gardens">>
<h2>🌿 Royal Gardens</h2>
<p>Late afternoon. Jasmine and cut herbs. The silver stag pours water from its antlers.</p>

<<if not $d2f_gardens>>
<div class="interaction-card main">
  <h4>🪨 The Stone Bench</h4>
  <p>The same bench. You can't stay in the chambers   the walls are closing in. Fewer eyes out here, down the servant stairs.</p>
  [[Sit → |day2_gardens]]
</div>
<</if>>

<<if $d2f_gardens and not $d2f_aldric>>
<div class="interaction-card main">
  <<npcPortrait "aldric" "Aldric">>
  <h4>👣 Footsteps on the Gravel</h4>
  <p>Heavy. Even. Someone rounding the hedge   he was always going to find you.</p>
  [[Look up → |day2_aldric]]
</div>
<</if>>

<<if $d2_npc_wynn and not $d2f_npc_wynn>>
<div class="interaction-card side">
  <<npcPortrait "wynn" "Old Wynn">>
  <h4>🌱 The Jasmine   New Growth</h4>
  <p>The old gardener, trowel in hand, tending shoots that are going in directions he didn't predict.</p>
  [[Approach → |day2_npc_wynn]]
</div>
<</if>>

<<if $d2f_gardens and $d2f_aldric and (not $d2_npc_wynn or $d2f_npc_wynn)>>
  <p class="empty-note">The garden is quiet. Just the fountain, the jasmine, and the long light.</p>
<</if>>

<div class="nav-return">
  [[← Return to Palace Hub|day2_hub]]
</div>
